300: the Equipment, identified by the given NId, does not exist;\r\n* 10992: the Equipment is frozen. ","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Creates extended process properties for the given piece of Equipment if none exists.\r\nList of properties: \r\n   - MinQuantity: The smallest quantity the piece of Equipment can handle.\r\n   - MinLevel: The smallest quantity which is recommended for the piece of Equipment.\r\n   - Quantity: The quantity that is stored in the piece of Equipment.\r\n   - MaxLevel: The biggest quantity recommended for the piece of Equipment.\r\n   - MaxQuantity: The biggest quantity the piece of Equipment can handle.\r\n   - IsSingleLot: A flag that indicates if the piece of Equipment should only handle a Material issued from a single lot.\r\n   - IsSingleMaterial: A flag that indicates if the piece of Equipment should only handle one kind of Material.\r\n   - AllocationStateMachineNId: The identifier of the State Machine on which the system will rely on, in order to manage the allocation state of the piece of Equipment. \r\n   - AllowedMaterialGroupNId: The Material Group allowed to be used with the piece of Equipment.\r\n   - AllowedMaterialNId: The Material allowed to be used with the piece of Equipment. \r\n\r\nThe command returns the following error codes in case of check failures:\r\n* 10300: the Equipment, identified by the given NId, does not exist;\r\n* 10992: the Equipment is frozen. "},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"405","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"316"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"406","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00","FullInfo":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00","InfoMap":{"$id":"407","FullIdObj":{"$id":"408","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00","FullInfo