hecks if :\r\n- the given Equipment Id exists, otherwise it throws the error 10300 \"Equipment with Id: { Id } does not exist.\";\r\n- the given Equipment isn't frozen, otherwise it throws the error 10992 \"Equipment with NId { Eqp.NId } is Frozen\";\r\n- the related ProcessAdditionalProperties exists, if it is the case, no error is thrown.","InfoMap":{"$id":"460","FullIdObj":{"$id":"461","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Updates the Quantity stored in the Equipment.\r\nChecks if :\r\n- the given Equipment Id exists, otherwise it throws the error 10300 \"Equipment with Id: { Id } does not exist.\";\r\n- the given Equipment isn't frozen, otherwise it throws the error 10992 \"Equipment with NId { Eqp.NId } is Frozen\";\r\n- the related ProcessAdditionalProperties exists, if it is the case, no error is thrown.","FullInfo":"Updates the Quantity stored in the Equipment.\r\nChecks if :\r\n- the given Equipment Id exists, otherwise it throws the error 10300 \"Equipment with Id: { Id } does not exist.\";\r\n- the given Equipment isn't frozen, otherwise it throws the error 10992 \"Equipment with NId { Eqp.NId } is Frozen\";\r\n- the related ProcessAdditionalProperties exists, if it is the case, no error is thrown.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"461"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Updates the Quantity stored in the Equipment.\r\nChecks if :\r\n- the given Equipment Id exists, otherwise it throws the error 10300 \"Equipment with Id: { Id } does not exist.\";\r\n- the given Equipment isn't frozen, otherwise it throws the error 10992 \"Equipment with NId { Eqp.NId } is Frozen\";\r\n- the related ProcessAdditionalProperties exists, if it is the case, no error is thrown.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Updates the Quantity stored in the Equipment.\r\nChecks if :\r\n- the given Equipment Id exists, otherwise it throws the error 10300 \"Equipment with Id: { Id } does not exist.\";\r\n- the given Equipment isn't frozen, otherwise it throws the error 10992 \"Equipment with NId { Eqp.NId } is Frozen\";\r\n- the related ProcessAdditionalProperties exists, if it is the case, no error is thrown."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"462","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"316"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"463","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00","FullInfo":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00","InfoMap":{"$id":"464","FullIdObj":{"$id":"465","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00","FullInfo":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"465"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"316"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@AddedOnMinorVersion=03.01.00"},{"$id":"466","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(228104f8-6e0d-4b1b-a3a8-e839c55d3b51)","FullInfo":"@Guid(228104f8-6e0d-4b1b-a3a8-e839c55d3b51)","InfoMap":{"$id":"467","FullIdObj":{"$id":"468","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(228104f8-6e0d-4b1b-a3a8-e839c55d3b51)","FullInfo":"@Guid(228104f8-6e0d-4b1b-a3a8-e839c55d3b51)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"468"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"316"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(228104f8-6e0d-4b1b-a3a8-e839c55d3b51)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(228104f8-6e0d-4b1b-a3a8-e839c55d3b51)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"AdjustEquipmentQuantity","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"AdjustEquipmentQuantity"},{"$id":"469","$type":"DslCommandInputDeclarationTree","Children":[{"$id":"470","$type":"DslKeywordNode"